[8] João Calvino, Institutas, 3.11.6.

[9] “Does Constant TV Watching Inhibit Brain Development?”, um relato de John Rosemond para o jornal Knight-Ridder, setembro de 1994.

[10] Ver Steven Ozment, When Fathers Ruled: Family Life in Reformation Europe (Cambridge: Harvard Univ., 1983).$conteudo$)
